    "id": "dispatch",
    "title": "客户端把模型调用转成MCP请求",
    "chapter": 3,
    "kind": "content",
    "body": "<div class=\"dispatch\"><section><h2>模型返回</h2><pre class=\"code\">namespace: mcp__course_files\nname: read_text_file\narguments: &quot;{…}&quot;\ncall_id: call_read_course_info</pre></section><div class=\"arrow\">→</div><section><h2>客户端发送给Server</h2><pre class=\"code\">method: tools/call\nparams.name: read_text_file\nparams.arguments: {…}\nid: 3</pre></section></div><p class=\"callout\">客户端找到course_files连接，解析参数，再发送tools/call。</p><p class=\"caption\">call_id对应模型侧调用；id对应这次MCP往返。两者由客户端关联。</p>",
    "notes": "两个编号的值为教学安排；模型API返回call_id，不等于声称它是模型逐Token生成。该路径由namespace和tool name解析到原server与tool，实际线协议工具名不含namespace。",
